assumption = "Another pre-existing code-versus-assertion conflict of the same shape as observation 1.2.2, hidden until the lookup succeeded; both sides left as written for a ruling on whether the readyz ruling extends to the by-activity body; task stays implemented; severity medium."
resolved   = "Leader ruling: the readyz ruling covers the by-activity body; the test asserts all eleven keys, protocol_network_id included; see gate.1.9.1."

